{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1081697-human-to-djinn-transformation-ideas","id":1081697,"title":"Human to Djinn transformation ideas?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-20T21:21:55-07:00","id":1081697,"title":"Human to Djinn transformation ideas?","content":"I am trying to think of ways a human might be transformed into a Djinn. It's for a story idea I have bouncing around in my head involving the kidnapped daughter of a Taftani but am sure if it will work. <br /> <br /> As I understand it, if you stay too long in a spirit realm you will become a spirit of that realm. So if a human stays too long in a Djinn realm, shouldn't they become a Djinn?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-20T22:18:01-07:00","id":1081709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1081697-human-to-djinn-transformation-ideas#post1081697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As I understand it, if you stay too long in a spirit realm you will become a spirit of that realm. So if a human stays too long in a Djinn realm, shouldn't they become a Djinn?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but they forget what they once were. It's the worse case of loss of self.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-20T22:38:59-07:00","id":1081713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1081697-human-to-djinn-transformation-ideas#post1081697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am trying to think of ways a human might be transformed into a Djinn. It's for a story idea I have bouncing around in my head involving the kidnapped daughter of a Taftani but am sure if it will work.<br /> <br /> As I understand it, if you stay too long in a spirit realm you will become a spirit of that realm. So if a human stays too long in a Djinn realm, shouldn't they become a Djinn?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Its more or less the case, there are ways to stop it, expand the time reduce the time etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;bas